;;;; RF / RSFSR discretionary rest-day transfers («О переносе выходных /
;;;; дней отдыха»). FROM becomes a compensatory working day; TO becomes an
;;;; extra day off. Automatic ТК ст. 112 weekend∩holiday moves are *not*
;;;; listed here.
;;;;
;;;; Coverage: every located normative act from Dec 1991 through 2026.
;;;; Years with no discretionary act (only automatic TK transfers): 1993
;;;; (aside from the NY span stored under 1994), 1998, 2004.
;;;;
;;;; Verified against ConsultantPlus / Garant / government.ru / pravo.gov.ru /
;;;; archival collections. 2000 used a Federal Law, not a Government decree.

